WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.234 --> 00:00:03.669
The first day of summer
is June 21st,

00:00:03.669 --> 00:00:06.772
and TSA officials are predicting
record-breaking travel.

00:00:06.772 --> 00:00:08.507
While most people plan to --
-Ahh.

00:00:08.507 --> 00:00:12.611
-Aah! I'm so sorry. this is one
of my writers, Lutz.

00:00:12.611 --> 00:00:16.382
Lutz, what are you doing?
-I'm relaxing after a long day

00:00:16.382 --> 00:00:19.218
at working here at "Late Night."
I invited you to join me.

00:00:19.218 --> 00:00:21.353
Didn't you get the invite?
-What invite?

00:00:21.353 --> 00:00:23.056
-Check your phone.
-I don't have my phone

00:00:23.056 --> 00:00:24.924
on me right now.
-Weird.

00:00:24.924 --> 00:00:27.493
Wally, you got the invite,
right?

00:00:27.493 --> 00:00:28.794
-You bet your sweet bippy,
I did.

00:00:28.794 --> 00:00:33.867
[ Laughter ]
-"You bet your sweet bippy"?

00:00:33.867 --> 00:00:36.502
-Seth, it's what all the
cool kids are saying.

00:00:36.502 --> 00:00:39.439
-Come on, Seth, let's have a
Heineken. It's after work.

00:00:39.439 --> 00:00:41.975
-It is most definitely
not after work.

00:00:41.975 --> 00:00:44.677
We just started the show.
-We did?

00:00:44.677 --> 00:00:47.346
-Yeah?
Do you not see the audience?

00:00:47.346 --> 00:00:49.381
-Yeah, but I thought
Wally just invited

00:00:49.381 --> 00:00:52.084
all of them to hang, too.
-You thought Wally

00:00:52.084 --> 00:00:56.755
invited an entire audience to
have a beer with just you guys?

00:00:56.755 --> 00:00:58.391
-Yeah.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:58.391 --> 00:01:04.964
Hey, hey, hey! It seems like
they wanted to do it, yes! Whoo!

00:01:04.964 --> 00:01:08.000
-Please, I'm begging
you, don't cheer for him.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:10.936
-Aw, Seth, come on. I'm just
trying to help you out.

00:01:10.936 --> 00:01:13.406
When you schedule time to block
your calendar after work

00:01:13.406 --> 00:01:15.775
with up to three friends,
Heineken may send you some

00:01:15.775 --> 00:01:18.578
beer money via Venmo towards
your first round.

00:01:18.578 --> 00:01:20.980
That way, you can combat
endless summer meetings

00:01:20.980 --> 00:01:24.316
and open some
work life-balance on them.

00:01:24.316 --> 00:01:27.853
-That does sound pretty good.
-You bet your sweet bippy.

00:01:27.853 --> 00:01:30.256
-Oh, my God.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:30.256 --> 00:01:32.892
But maybe we could do this whole
thing after the show.

00:01:32.892 --> 00:01:34.893
-Or how about
at the commercial break?

00:01:34.893 --> 00:01:36.095
-Alright, fine.

00:01:36.095 --> 00:01:39.832 line:0%
visit Heineken.com/closer
for beer money via Venmo,

00:01:39.832 --> 00:01:42.568 line:0%
plus other surprises for you and
your friends this summer.

00:01:42.568 --> 00:01:45.171
-And be cool like me.
Wink.

00:01:45.171 --> 00:01:48.975
[ Cheers and applause ]
-And me. Wink.

00:01:48.975 --> 00:01:54.046
-You guys don't need --
I keep telling you,

00:01:54.046 --> 00:01:57.483
you don't need to say "wink"
if you actually wink.

00:01:57.483 --> 00:01:58.684
-Oh.
[ Light laughter ]

00:01:58.684 --> 00:02:00.353
-We'll be right back
with more "Late Night."

00:02:00.353 --> 00:02:03.223 line:0%
[ Cheers and applause ]

